1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,094
The Little Prince and Qiqi kept flying forward.

2
00:00:04,044 --> 00:00:08,102
This time, they came to a planet full of books.

3
00:00:08,102 --> 00:00:10,382
So many books!

4
00:00:10,382 --> 00:00:13,250
Stacked higher than houses!

5
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:16,220
Qiqi curiously opened one.

6
00:00:16,220 --> 00:00:21,514
Wow, it had pictures of mountains, rivers, and oceans!

7
00:00:21,514 --> 00:00:26,485
An old man with round glasses sat in the middle of the book piles.

8
00:00:26,485 --> 00:00:28,411
Who are you?

9
00:00:28,411 --> 00:00:30,588
Qiqi asked.

10
00:00:30,588 --> 00:00:32,867
I'm a geographer.

11
00:00:32,867 --> 00:00:35,676
I write books about the world.

12
00:00:35,676 --> 00:00:38,970
Then you must know so many places!

13
00:00:38,970 --> 00:00:42,720
Of course, I've written them all in my books.

14
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:45,044
Qiqi's eyes lit up.

15
00:00:45,044 --> 00:00:48,602
Then you must have been to so many places!

16
00:00:48,602 --> 00:00:52,088
The geographer pushed up his glasses.

17
00:00:52,088 --> 00:00:53,455
Me?

18
00:00:53,455 --> 00:00:55,897
I've never been outside.

19
00:00:55,897 --> 00:00:57,499
What?

20
00:00:57,499 --> 00:01:00,264
Qiqi's mouth dropped open.

21
00:01:00,264 --> 00:01:03,264
Geographers don't go outside.

22
00:01:03,264 --> 00:01:06,058
We only write things down.

23
00:01:06,058 --> 00:01:09,367
Then who tells you what mountains look like?

24
00:01:09,367 --> 00:01:11,661
Explorers do.

25
00:01:11,661 --> 00:01:17,485
They go out and see things, then come back and tell me, and I write it down.

26
00:01:17,485 --> 00:01:20,117
Qiqi thought for a moment.

27
00:01:20,117 --> 00:01:23,749
She ran to the book piles and sniffed hard.

28
00:01:23,749 --> 00:01:25,058
Mmm...

29
00:01:25,058 --> 00:01:27,794
the books smell like paper.

30
00:01:27,794 --> 00:01:30,544
But they don't smell like wind.

31
00:01:30,544 --> 00:01:34,661
No smell of flowers, no smell of rain either.

32
00:01:34,661 --> 00:01:37,352
The geographer was stunned.

33
00:01:37,352 --> 00:01:45,279
The Little Prince said softly — Books hold a lot of knowledge, but only by really going there can you smell the wind.

34
00:01:45,279 --> 00:01:47,838
Qiqi nodded firmly.

35
00:01:47,838 --> 00:01:51,397
When I grow up, I'll go see for myself!

36
00:01:51,397 --> 00:01:54,838
I'll write the smell of wind into books too!

37
00:01:54,838 --> 00:01:58,735
The geographer smiled and picked up his quill.

38
00:01:58,735 --> 00:02:01,294
Then you'll be an explorer.

39
00:02:01,294 --> 00:02:06,764
Go ahead, come back and tell me what the wind on the mountains smells like.

40
00:02:06,764 --> 00:02:10,426
Kids, where would you most like to explore?

41
00:02:10,426 --> 00:02:13,235
Tell Qiqi in the comments

